  "solution": "The logic followed here is : (1st number - 3rd number) × 9 = 2nd number\n\nGiven :\n\n__\n \n• (20, 90, 10)\n\n​**(20 - 10)**__ × 9 = 90\n\n__**10 × 9**__ = 90\n\n90 = 90 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (25, 135, 10)\n\n​(25 - 10)__ × 9 = 135\n\n__15 × 9__ = 135\n\n135 = 135 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : (18, 72, 10) \n\n​(18 - 10)__ × 9 = 72\n\n__8 × 9__ = 72\n\n72 = 72 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : (19, 80, 15)\n\n​(19 - 15)__ × 9 = 80\n\n__4 × 9__ = 80\n\n36 ≠ 80 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : (22, 150, 7) \n\n​(22 - 7)__ × 9 = 150\n\n__15 × 9__ = 150\n\n135 ≠ 150 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : (30, 169, 12)\n\n​(30 - 12)__ × 9 = 169\n\n__18 × 9__ = 169\n\n162 ≠ 169 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.\n\n52:T3351,",
